     MOVE "15/15/1 aaaaaaaaaaaaaab 15/15/0 aaaaaaaaaaaaaaa 15/15/0 aaaaaaaaaaaaaaa 6/6/1 ababcd 3/3/1 hXYo 15/1" &
         "5/1 zzzzzzzzzzzzzzz 0/0/1 <> 1/1/1 abc " TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 40-8§4 BookSignScreen: 4 behaviour 1 and 14: setValue cuts the text to the maximum l" &
