     CALL "MN8-FIELDSET" USING MN8-FLD WS-TA WS-TL
     MOVE MN8-FCUR TO WS-R1
     MOVE MN8-FANC TO WS-R2
     MOVE MN8-FCHANGED TO WS-R3
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
